			"tooltipExtended": "Twisted Fate begins shuffling his deck, allowing him to <recast>Recast</recast> to lock in one of three cards and enhance his next Attack.<br><li>The Blue Card deals <magicDamage>@ttBlueDamage@ = (</magicDamage><trueDamage>@BlueBase@</trueDamage><scaleAD> +@ttAD*100@% %i:scaleAD%</scaleAD><scaleAP> +@ttBlueAP*100@%%i:scaleAP%</scaleAP><magicDamage>)</magicDamage> increased by %i:scaleCrit% up to @BlueCritMultiplier*100@%<magicDamage> magic damage</magicDamage> and restores <scaleMana>@Effect6Amount@ Mana</scaleMana>.<li>The Red Card deals <magicDamage>@ttRedDamage@ = (</magicDamage><trueDamage>@RedBase@</trueDamage><scaleAD> +@ttAD*100@% %i:scaleAD%</scaleAD><scaleAP> +@ttRedAP*100@%%i:scaleAP%</scaleAP><magicDamage>)</magicDamage> increased by %i:scaleCrit% up to @RedCritMultiplier*100@%<magicDamage> magic damage</magicDamage> to nearby enemies and <status>Slows</status> by @Effect2Amount@% for 2.5 seconds.<li>The Gold Card deals <magicDamage>@ttGoldDamage@ = (</magicDamage><trueDamage>@GoldBase@</trueDamage><scaleAD> +@ttAD*100@% %i:scaleAD%</scaleAD><scaleAP> +@ttGoldAP*100@%%i:scaleAP%</scaleAP><magicDamage>)</magicDamage> increased by %i:scaleCrit% up to @GoldCritMultiplier*100@%<magicDamage> magic damage</magicDamage> and <status>Stuns</status> for @Effect3Amount@ seconds."
